  "description": "Do I need a sweet dating experience to draw a romance webtoon? Seung-ah, who dreams of becoming a romance webtoonist, is trying to find her own first love like everyone else, but what does teen hair loss mean?! Whether it's luck or misfortune that's when the school's two-top dominance and absurdity begins.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58286091), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%A8%EC%A3%BC%EC%99%80-%EA%B7%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%8A%94-%EB%A1%9C%EB%A7%A8%EC%8A%A4/2741)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/108976)",
